               <title>Questions or comments?</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>To report SUSPECTED ADVERSE REACTIONS, contact the FDA at 1-800-FDA-1088 or https://www.fda.gov/medwatch/report.htm</paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
